<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Compte suspendu</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { background: #dc2626; padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .reason-box { background: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f9f9f9; color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header"><h1>Compte suspendu</h1></div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Bonjour {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>Votre compte BilletiX a été suspendu par un administrateur.</p>
      {{#if reason}}
      <div class="reason-box"><strong>Motif :</strong> {{reason}}</div>
      {{/if}}
      <p>Si vous pensez qu'il s'agit d'une erreur, contactez le support BilletiX.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">© {{year}} BilletiX — Tous droits réservés</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
